&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;TripleLift is the Creative SSP powered by TL Spark, our agentic intelligence layer. We orchestrate creative, supply, audience, and measurement into a single outcome-driven system across the open internet, retail media, and CTV. Our platform enables brands and agencies to drive measurable performance while helping publishers maximize yield and preserve high-quality user experiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As AI reshapes how brands plan, buy, optimize, and measure media, we are embedding intelligence across creative, curation, targeting, activation, and measurement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Director&lt;/strong&gt; to lead how we bring new demand products to market.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This leader will define positioning, packaging, and go-to-market strategy across CTV, video, native, retail media, and emerging formats. They will translate complex machine learning, predictive models, and automation capabilities into clear business outcomes for brands, agencies, and publishers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a high-impact, revenue-facing role at the center of Product, Sales, and Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Positioning &amp;amp; Messaging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead positioning for product capabilities across predictive audience modeling, intelligent curation, creative optimization, automation, and AI-powered planning and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical capabilities into clear business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop differentiated messaging versus legacy platforms and point solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Launch Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end GTM for demand product launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define ICP, use cases, buyer personas, and packaging strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align launches to quarterly pipeline goals across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Alignment &amp;amp; Pipeline Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with ABM and Demand Gen to ensure messaging supports in-market and out-market campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align messaging to account journey stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build enablement materials that support high-value, complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement for Intelligent Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop narratives that demonstrate how AI reduces waste, improves performance, and accelerates activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build competitive battlecards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI positioning into enterprise sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership in AI-Driven Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape POV on how AI is transforming media buying, CTV monetization, retail media, and creative performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop content optimized for AI-influenced search and buyer behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as connective tissue between Product, Engineering, Sales, ABM, and MOPs.&lt;br&gt;Help operationalize account intelligence within marketing and sales workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Product Marketing within AdTech, MarTech, AI SaaS, or media platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing machine learning, automation, or predictive modeling products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency with the ability to translate complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record launching complex AI-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a marketing leader, you have demonstrated experience as a technically credible, strategic storyteller.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, revenue-oriented operator able to develop excellent cross-functional working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Jobs:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;The base salary range represents the low and high end of the TripleLift US salary range for this position. Actual salaries will vary depending on factors including but not limited to experience and performance. The range listed is just one component of TripleLift’s total compensation package for employees. Other rewards may include bonuses, an open Paid Time Off policy, and many region-specific benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Pay is based on various non-discriminatory factors including but not limited to experience, education, and skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Benefits Available to Eligible Employees Include the following*:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#39;Open Sans&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Medical, Dental &amp;amp; Vision Plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#39;Open Sans&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;401k w/ employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Full-time employees are eligible for comprehensive benefits (subject to the terms of applicable plans/policies/agreements, which will be made available to you after commencing employment).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At TripleLift, we believe great work starts with great people. We foster a culture built on collaboration, curiosity, and a shared commitment to making each other better. We move with urgency, challenge convention, and continuously innovate to elevate digital advertising. We value people who bring new perspectives, take ownership, and work together to drive meaningful impact. Learn more about TripleLift and our culture on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/triplelift/life/tripleliftpeopleculturecommunity&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn Life page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://triplelift.com/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for information about how TripleLift handles personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TripleLift does not accept unsolicited resumes from recruitment search firms. Any resume submitted without a signed agreement in place will become the property of TripleLift, and no fee will be due.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
